  "updated_at": "2026-04-02",
  "bio": "Remy B is an extraordinarily talented tattoo artist, renowned for creating stunning works of art in geometric, tribal, and floral styles. Originating from Marseille, France, his unique approach integrates elements of ornamentation, geometry, and motion in each design. With an impressive following of more than 100k on Instagram, he is not just a tattoo artist but a trendsetter in the industry. Rightly so, he is the founder of Prismetattoo, a brand celebrated for its creative and cutting edge designs.\nPrice: $$$\nCurrent location: Marseille, Provence-alpes-cote D'azur, France"
}
